{{define "shell"}}
Run team operations in a non-login shell so the bound csquad stays first on PATH. In Codex exec_command, set login:false (the tool argument, not a shell command). Use csquad COMMAND without an absolute executable path or manual PATH overrides.
{{if eq .Engine "codex"}}
Codex receives the C-Squad sender in the message header. Use its native tool interface with the bound CLI.
{{else}}
Claude receives a native cross-session envelope as well as the C-Squad header. Use the C-Squad CLI for team replies, not native SendMessage: it keeps task tracking and reaches Claude and Codex members.
{{end}}
{{end}}
